# SOUNDINGS: shields take their share off every hit while held (a bulwark
# 25 %), defending with one doubles it, and two bulwarks and a defend take a
# blow to nothing. A diver defending another takes the blows meant for him.
game soundings
wait 30
press A
wait 20
cheat equip 0 0 22
cheat equip 0 1 23
cheat shield_def 0
expect calc == 50
cheat hp 1 0
cheat hp 2 0
cheat fight 0
waituntil bphase == 1 200
cheat foehp 0 20000
cheat seed 1
# Moss defends himself behind both bulwarks
press A
press UP
expect tmode == 1
expect tsel == 0
press A
waituntil bround == 2 900
waituntil bphase == 1 600
expect last_target == 0
expect last_dmg == 0
expect hp0 == 500
# now he strikes with one: half of a fizzle's bite
press A
press A
waituntil bround == 3 900
waituntil bphase == 1 600
expect last_dmg >= 59
expect last_dmg <= 75
